'' A module's OVERLOAD with windows.bi's own parameters, 'GetDesktopWindow overload( ) as HWND',
'' is TKO0677 (RFC-0001 F4). It was taken for the body of user32's declaration -- a
'' definition of GetDesktopWindow under its Windows name, out of the interface, silently.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 -i tests/modules/src/ovjoin/libs tests/modules/src/ovjoin/app/header.tiko -o tests/modules/ovjoin-header.exe
'' ENV: TKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' ENV: TKO_INCLUDE=toolchains/tiko-windows/inc
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 1
'' EXPECT-MAX-DIAG: 1
'' EXPECT-OUT: qy.tiko(6,8): error TKO0677: 'getdesktopwindow' is already declared with these parameter types
'' EXPECT-OUT: winuser.bi(4594,9): note: declared here
